cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Evergreen or its lifecycle dataset in a paper, post, or tool, cite it as below."
title: "Evergreen: local-first deprecation intelligence and lifecycle rules"
abstract: >-
  Evergreen finds end-of-life and deprecated runtimes, packages, and GitHub Actions in a
  repository, reports the exact file and line, and backs every finding with an authoritative
  source, a replacement, and migration steps. This citation covers the Evergreen source code,
  CLI, GitHub Action, MCP server, and Agent Skill together with the reviewed lifecycle rules
  and end-of-life dates bundled in the registry.
type: software
authors:
